Shame on you! Shame on you!

296
00:19:01.120 --> 00:19:04.240
Shame on you! Shame on you!

297
00:19:04.320 --> 00:19:07.760
Shame on you! Shame on you!

298
00:19:07.840 --> 00:19:09.080
Shame on you!

